# FlowProof local environment template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and set a real value. `.env` is ignored by Git and must
# never be committed, printed, or pasted into logs, reports, fixtures, or issues.
#
# MODEL_API_KEY is the Meta Model API key used for the live Hero run and the opt-in
# protocol smoke. It is read only from the process environment or from this ignored
# local file through `node --env-file-if-exists=.env`; an already exported value takes
# precedence. The key is never written to run artifacts, model input, or diagnostics.
MODEL_API_KEY=
